{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "826940f4f9a6609e80f828d92a42a02d10a7833f2c5a1d232580f655a07b597b", "ja": "『JCC』から新たなイベントへの出演依頼\nがあり、BOT公演とのコラボが決定。今回\nのメンバーは莉緒、美也、美希、ジュリア。\nファッションの仕事という事もあり、みんな\nのテンションは高め。今回も激戦の予感！", "zh": "收到来自“JCC”的新活动出演邀请，\n并决定与BOT公演联动。这次的\n成员是莉绪、美也、美希和茱莉亚。\n由于是时尚方面的工作，大家的\n兴致都很高涨。预感这次也会是一场激战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ff0ed78f2fd3ca68d79b2226e593865e262ea53f7a53bb1c9c9dbfadbbebca2f", "ja": "（調整の結果、『BATTLE OF THEATER』と\nJCCのコラボが決まった）", "zh": "（经过协调，『BATTLE OF THEATER』和JCC的合作确定了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "502fb5d0957719a38d72af7af624ff0ab647a6d6c841f755effe341f74f73624", "ja": "（先方とのミーティングはまだ先だけど、ひとまず\n出演メンバーが決まったので集まってもらった）", "zh": "（虽然和对方的会议还要过一阵子，但出演成员已经确定了，所以先把她们召集了过来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "9b151dc2439fb5c17a67815474bdea25e6f58ec499df91a7d18e5228a81946b4", "ja": "ええっ！？　私たち、JCCのファッションショーに\n出られるの？　すごいじゃなーい！！", "zh": "诶！？我们要参加JCC的时装秀吗？太棒了吧——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "43ea5602fc43ad4e68be2191f23571491c42e1e5ff3b9bc5e50a99840dcb878a", "ja": "ミキは、この前も出演したけど。\nまた出てもいーの？", "zh": "美希之前也参加过，不过还能再参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7f0295b8341d2964c1770844a5493feff08f06c57f2f9a93855a068d542abd73", "ja": "うん、美希には経験者としてお願いしたいそうだ。\nターゲット層の年齢とも合ってるしな。", "zh": "嗯，对方说是想找美希作为有经验的人来出演。\n而且和目标受众的年龄段也相符。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f07588e7b2ca6a94f611280cadfb9c60aeb7dbb9a1b68fcc41debe54b8d503c0", "ja": "とはいえ、今回はまた違う系統の\nファッションになるらしいから、よろしく！", "zh": "不过，听说这次又是另一种风格的时尚，所以就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "60a7da8f7266ccf16e2c54c065cd0c479c00bc4e2fcf287f8f28009ef1d958f3", "ja": "ホント？　すっごく楽しみなの～。", "zh": "真的？人家超期待的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "b8b6fbba2cca3e92ceebdf8cdf7191b8aca7141252bcaa1cee9e708d6ad74825", "ja": "おっ？　美希、今日は居眠りしないんだな。", "zh": "哦？美希，你今天不打瞌睡了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "62be52ea5bb599bbec4c8d8b5fd279dd0aef9eabece144b5e6b8bbc04e0597ff", "ja": "うん。ミキ、JCCのお仕事はけっこー好きかも？\nカワイイ衣装、いっぱい着られるし☆", "zh": "嗯。美希可能还挺喜欢JCC的工作的？\n能穿好多可爱的服装☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "2005d0f209f47927ed0a2cd9c91252a901dee6164d0d811d866815911237ab17", "ja": "おー。美希ちゃん、やる気満々ですね～。\nこれは私も、気合いを入れなければなりませんな～。", "zh": "哦～美希干劲十足呢～  \n我也必须打起精神来才行呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "8ed8fd4ed23a5bd65e5301ae8fefa5c7ff6c56466e6ca6ea1142604e0074588f", "ja": "そうそう。ただのファションショーじゃなくて、\n『BATTLE OF THEATER』でもあるのよね？", "zh": "对对。不只是普通的时装秀，也是『BATTLE OF THEATER』，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cf2692485f9085c10e08d16a8fc7ee3a41c1fde6618b2b31b345deca16dfa2a4", "ja": "そうだな、その方向で進めてるよ。\nショーとライブで、結果を競う形になりそうだ。", "zh": "没错，我们就是按这个方向推进的。\n看来会采取让时装秀和演唱会比拼结果的形式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "6b0e5fcca6c0f31ae1def17a89691a5274426726c452b8eaa6197cc74143b98b", "ja": "つまり、私の脚線美の出番ってことね！\n若い子たちには負けないわよ～！", "zh": "也就是说，该轮到我展现美腿了！\n我可不会输给年轻女孩们哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "1b4791b9a4545f596d87936b0615bab8da6ddbcad7e64761c6c58c2a01c8f16a", "ja": "むふふ、楽しくなってきました～。\n私も、負けませんよ～。むんっ。", "zh": "呵呵呵，越来越有意思了～\n我也不会输的哦～。嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "97876a3bf0291cff9d106996534cbe38c49177c61338ea73338c5d3d8f725f66", "ja": "しかしファッションショーって……\nなんか、あたしだけ場違いじゃないか？", "zh": "可是时装秀什么的……\n总觉得只有我一个人不太合适吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "79a88945acf6630a0e2f63f4d579f7aafe6837a2c115141adc94e53762a524ee", "ja": "そんなことないって思うな。\nジュリアはカワイイし、ヘーキなの。", "zh": "我觉得不是那样哦。茱莉亚很可爱，没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "b793ddd3876f2d04eaf4302400a3e66e9468be3771ac334624f0f1b14d73d98e", "ja": "いや、さらっと言ってくれるな……。\nま、やる前から弱気はダサいよな。やってやるさ！", "zh": "话是说得真轻巧啊……\n不过，还没做就先犯怂也太逊了。放马过来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6e55dee44de11699ed1019c141b861deb3bab8574c3ed8c9a0781caf854e582d", "ja": "おお……\nみんな、最初からテンションが高いな！", "zh": "哦哦……\n大家从一开始情绪就很高涨啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "ca044ff1706895f4ff0cd5b505f3c3e848e72b34cef0dac28bb2dc427db0f713", "ja": "当たり前じゃない！　ファッションショーなのよ？\nやっぱり、憧れなのよね～♪", "zh": "那当然啦！这可是时装秀哦？\n果然还是让人很憧憬呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "f1087b9c6d8370b03c0640963d59e3f1cb26cdf1dc8790b2067858ed0301804b", "ja": "アイドルのお仕事で、たまにアパレル系の\nCMとかもあるけど、やっぱりテンション上がるし。", "zh": "偶像工作中偶尔也会接到服装品牌的广告，但这种机会还是会让人兴奋呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "356def79441e0fb760fef347dbc0271aba55c91cd19d747d1afd0be52204e2e4", "ja": "そうですね～。私も、いつもと違うファッションが\nできるのは、とってもうれしいですな～。ふふふ。", "zh": "是啊～我也很开心能尝试和平时不一样的时尚打扮呢～呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "fd458a7209b318095bafc41011ea517a0e7d136f9b988f81ae2d170af3652cf8", "ja": "いつもと違うオシャレ、テンション上がるもんね☆\nステージ以外のミキもいっぱい見てほしいって思うな。", "zh": "平时不一样的打扮，真的很让人兴奋呢☆\n美希也想让大家多多看到舞台之外的美希哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "5bd84f9f3dd6b14e042fa4e8cf7d2d60fa19087f377d835ae16af1290914ff97", "ja": "そ、そういうもんか……。あたしはやっぱり、\nステージパフォーマンス以外は得意じゃないけど。", "zh": "是、是这样的吗……我果然还是不太擅长舞台表演以外的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "f17864e2c9d7d6f82c581bbba4828b2f3b52dadcfac55e8b9c8ce427a95bf529", "ja": "でも、ファンのみんなが喜んでくれるなら、\nがんばらないと。今回は、勝負でもあるしな！", "zh": "不过，只要粉丝们能开心，我就得努力才行。这次也是一场较量嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9cc57477f07476881ddaeefe6186e10dd4de27799928b6fe3c6a28e0ad391121", "ja": "なるほど……色んな理由があるんだな。\n納得したよ。", "zh": "原来如此……有各种各样的理由啊。\n我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "2c3326659653798cc0ac6bf1ccf5b8d7f556df80a15b7466fe7a9eb4f2419360", "ja": "ファッションショーって、一つのステータスだもの。\n認められた、って気がするわよね！", "zh": "时装秀可是身份地位的象征。被认可了的感觉，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "9042a2ef16a87cf11f543e5f8fdbd22c4a852585c40b303f454910fb90cd726f", "ja": "けど、今回は真剣勝負でもありますから～。\n作戦を考えないといけませんな～。む～ん……。", "zh": "不过，这次也是一场认真较量，所以～\n得好好想想作战方案才行呢～唔嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1027_042miy", "source_sha256": "15da64bb39566129a70433b1f2493d4002543c1ee54135b7153ceee85d8f8dbc", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n衣装はどんな感じなんでしょう～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n服装会是什么样的呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "bc78130f966368c5c44e58f33d9a8ca511538ebeda4d003bee72e557e46335f2", "ja": "今回、衣装は先方が用意してくれる事になっている。\nとりあえずはそれ待ちだな。", "zh": "这次服装由对方负责准备。总之，先等他们送来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "12c928b13b160b1ec31709c788d571d98db3a3fd803a0ec5d707d25d368ddd6b", "ja": "{$P$}、衣装が届いたら、\nすぐ連絡してね？　届かなくても連絡してね！", "zh": "{$P$}，服装送到后，要马上联系我哦？就算还没送到也要联系我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "e6694564cd211adb87d5c075d6dd212b7795357785789a76af390dd07ee1f069", "ja": "うん、届いたらすぐ知らせるよ。", "zh": "嗯，到了之后我会马上告诉你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_01_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "e54d467ad6c64babdd6fb694453cefd3491326c37d8b464a88546d3901041222", "ja": "へえ……みんな、気合い入った顔してるな。\n今回は全員、ライバルだもんな。", "zh": "哦……大家看起来都干劲十足啊。\n这次所有人都是对手嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
